# The browser extension is a separate build artifact with its own package.json
# and node_modules. The Dockerfile does `COPY . .`, so without this its source
# and dependencies would ride into the builder layer for nothing.
extension
# The mobile app, for the same reason and more so: Expo's dependency tree is an
# order of magnitude larger than esbuild's, so leaving it out of the ignore list
# would drag several hundred megabytes into the builder layer and bust its cache
# on every mobile change.
mobile
